{"verses":[{"number":1,"text":"LORD|strong=\"H3068\", how my|strong=\"H1732\"adversaries have|strong=\"H1121\"increased!  \nMany are|strong=\"H1121\"those|strong=\"H1121\"who|strong=\"H1121\"rise up|strong=\"H1121\"against|strong=\"H6440\"me|strong=\"H6440\".   \n"},{"number":2,"text":"Many|strong=\"H7227\"there|strong=\"H3068\"are|strong=\"H4100\"who|strong=\"H3068\"say of|strong=\"H3068\"my|strong=\"H3068\"soul,  \n“There|strong=\"H3068\"is|strong=\"H3068\"no|strong=\"H6965\"help|strong=\"H6965\"for|strong=\"H5921\"him|strong=\"H5921\"in|strong=\"H5921\"God|strong=\"H3068\".” Selah."},{"number":3,"text":"But|strong=\"H7227\"you|strong=\"H5315\", LORD|strong=\"H3068\", are|strong=\"H7227\"a|strong=\"H3068\"shield around me|strong=\"H5315\",  \nmy|strong=\"H5315\"glory, and|strong=\"H5315\"the|strong=\"H3444\"one|strong=\"H7227\"who|strong=\"H5315\"lifts up my|strong=\"H5315\"head.   \n"},{"number":4,"text":"I|strong=\"H3068\"cry to|strong=\"H3068\"the|strong=\"H3068\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\"with|strong=\"H3068\"my|strong=\"H3068\"voice,  \nand|strong=\"H3068\"he|strong=\"H3068\"answers me|strong=\"H1157\"out of|strong=\"H3068\"his|strong=\"H3068\"holy hill. Selah."},{"number":5,"text":"I|strong=\"H3068\"laid myself down|strong=\"H7121\"and|strong=\"H3068\"slept.  \nI|strong=\"H3068\"awakened, for|strong=\"H7121\"the|strong=\"H3068\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\"sustains me|strong=\"H6963\".   \n"},{"number":6,"text":"I|strong=\"H3588\"will|strong=\"H3068\"not|strong=\"H3588\"be|strong=\"H3068\"afraid of|strong=\"H3068\"tens of|strong=\"H3068\"thousands of|strong=\"H3068\"people  \nwho|strong=\"H3068\"have|strong=\"H3068\"set|strong=\"H5564\"themselves against|strong=\"H3068\"me|strong=\"H3588\"on|strong=\"H3068\"every|strong=\"H3068\"side.   \n"},{"number":7,"text":"Arise, LORD|strong=\"H3068\"!  \nSave me|strong=\"H5921\", my|strong=\"H5921\"God|strong=\"H3808\"!  \nFor|strong=\"H5921\"you|strong=\"H5921\"have|strong=\"H5971\"struck all|strong=\"H5439\"of|strong=\"H5971\"my|strong=\"H5921\"enemies on|strong=\"H5921\"the|strong=\"H5921\"cheek bone.  \nYou|strong=\"H5921\"have|strong=\"H5971\"broken the|strong=\"H5921\"teeth of|strong=\"H5971\"the|strong=\"H5921\"wicked.   \n"},{"number":8,"text":"Salvation|strong=\"H3467\"belongs to|strong=\"H3068\"the|strong=\"H3605\"LORD|strong=\"H3068\".  \nMay|strong=\"H3068\"your|strong=\"H3068\"blessing be|strong=\"H3068\"on|strong=\"H3068\"your|strong=\"H3068\"people|strong=\"H7563\". Selah."}]}
